131 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 105 0 R
/E (We are delighted and deeply honoured to welcome you aboard the International Press of this Model United Nations edition. When you hear International Press, you may think of interviews, press conferences, newspapers, and more. However, journalism is a vast ocean, and in this Model United Nations simulation, you will take on the roles of journalists and photojournalists to experience it yourself. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
132 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 105 0 R
/E (As the executive board of the International Press, we want to remind you that we expect and accept all your little flaws in hopes that you learn something new from them and make your work close to perfection. Overcoming obstacles can only be achieved when one is willing to push oneself and not just think but work outside the box. At the same time, you should remember that diplomacy and transparency are the highest forms of respect, and all members of the International Press are expected to adhere to them. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
133 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 105 0 R
/E (To effectively tackle the challenges of this role, we highly recommend that members start their preliminary research well in advance to produce flawless work. Despite the competition, unlike other committees of the MUN, the International Press is a team. Our ultimate goal is to acquire resourceful articles and good-quality photos for an informative newsletter. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
134 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 105 0 R
/E ('Hesitation causes hindrance to perfection and shows the path to defeat', please do not hesitate to voice your queries, and feel free to reach out anytime. We hope you all have a wonderful experience, and we are looking forward to an engaging conference and working with all of you )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
135 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 105 0 R
/E (Regards, )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
